        <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;b&gt;Publish flow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Click Publish; request lands on any VM&lt;br&gt;2. Project written to shared volume&lt;br&gt;3. npm install via Artifactory, build with BASE_PATH=/apps/&amp;lt;appId&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;4. Bind a free port on this VM, start as AIT service ID, health check&lt;br&gt;5. Write registry/&amp;lt;appId&amp;gt;.json&lt;br&gt;6. Return https://builder-host/apps/&amp;lt;appId&amp;gt;/&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Request flow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;user &amp;#8594; any VM proxy &amp;#8594; registry lookup &amp;#8594; owning VM ip:port&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Per VM:&lt;/b&gt; ports, running processes, proxy, reconciler&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Shared:&lt;/b&gt; builder, applications, env variables, registry&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Reconciler restarts apps of a lost VM on a healthy VM and updates the registry; the URL does not change." vertex="1">
